-- Two-sided ideals of a bundled ring: Ideal(R, I) under a ring hypothesis,
-- the proper and maximal ideals, the ring notation on the elements of an
-- ideal, the bridges to the forms over separate pieces, and the closure
-- instances; everything here is ZF
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
